<p>aye roze-daaro aa-ho buka ke ye roz hai<br />
sadaath par nuzool-o bala ke ye roz hai<br />
sartaaj-e ousiya ki azaa ke ye roz hai<br />
tum se wida-e shere khuda ke ye roz hai</p>

<p>zaqmi huwa imaam tumhara namaz me<br />
zalim ne rozedaar ko maara namaaz me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>maahe mubarak-e ramaza'n aur quda ka ghar<br />
tadka wo noor ka wo shab-e- qadr ki sahar<br />
pesh-e quda wo sajde me shere quda ka sar<br />
aur haaye teghe zulm ki zarbat wo farq par</p>

<p>fawwaare qoo'n ke zaqme jabee'n se baha kiye<br />
sajde me aap rabbi-ul- aala kaha kiye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sar peeto momino sare hyder huwa do neem<br />
imaa'n ke burj ka mae-anwar huwa do neem<br />
socho to farq shaah ka kyu kar huwa do neem<br />
likkha hai maghz tak sar-e at'har huwa do neem</p>

<p>zehra ne baal khole nabi nange sar huwe<br />
tum be imam aur hassan be pidar huwe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>likkha hai jab do neem huwa farq-e murtaza<br />
sidre se jibraeel ke rone ka ghul utha<br />
phainki saro'n se zainab-o kulsoom ne rida<br />
chillake bhaiyo'n ko pukaari ghazab huwa</p>

<p>sunte ho jibraeel ne is waqt kya kaha<br />
wo bole peet kar qatal-al murtaza kaha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>doudhe ye kehke jaanib-e masjid wo nek zaat<br />
doobi huwi lahu me mili kashti-e najaat<br />
maathe pe qoon baap ka malkar kahi ye baat<br />
hae hae uthaya qibla-o kaaba pa kisne haat</p>

<p>rulwaya nana jaan ko daarus-salam me<br />
bin baap ka kiya hame maahe siyaam me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nagaah namaziyo'n ka guroh aaya nange sar<br />
hyder ne mujtaba se kaha aankhe khol kar<br />
padhwao tum namaaz jama-at ki aye pisar<br />
ham baithe baithe padhte hai apne maqam par</p>

<p>lekin jabee'n ke zaqm pe roomal bandh do<br />
mera sare shigaafta aye laal bandh do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baandha hassan ne zaqm-e sar-e shaah-e zuljalaal<br />
bole ali ke aur kaso dard hai kamaal<br />
shabbar ne jab kasa to kiya phir wahi meqaal<br />
phir chust baandh kar ye pukara ye wo qushqisaal</p>

<p>ab dard kaisa hai asad-e zuljalaal hai<br />
hatho'n se sar pakad ke kaha wahi haal hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>padhwa ke phir namaaz jama-at ki mujtaba<br />
baba ke sar pa padhne lage aaya-e shifa<br />
nagaah aake ye kisi aurat ne di nidaa<br />
zehra ke pyaro tum se ye zainab ne hai kaha</p>

<p>baba ko mere jald jo ghar me na laaoge<br />
to sar barehna mujh ko bhi masjid me paaoge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bole ali hawaas abhi se baja nahi<br />
zainab se kehdo koofa hai ye karbala nahi<br />
mai be dayaaro bekas-o be aashna nahi<br />
shiaa hai gird nargha-e ahle jafaa nahi</p>

<p>parde se nange sar tu abhi kyu nikalti hai<br />
kya halq par hussain ke talwar chalti hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ummul banee'n ko paya jo sadme me mubtela<br />
baahe'n gale me daal ke abbas ne kaha<br />
aye amma sadqa dene se rad hoti hai bala<br />
bhai hassan hussain hai zehra ke dilruba</p>

<p>roshan karo jahaan me tum apne naam ko<br />
sadqa utaaro shaah-e najaf par ghulam ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye sunke us hiraas me sambhli wo beqaraar<br />
leke balaae'n boli chalo mere gullezar<br />
baba pa tum nisaar ho tum par ye maa nisaar<br />
chillai badh ke majma-e matam me ek baar</p>

<p>saidaniyo randape ke gham se panaah do<br />
sadqa utaarne ko mai aayi hu raah do<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bole ali tu hosh me aye nouha gar nahi<br />
abbas ke weqaar ki tujh ko qabar nahi<br />
ye fatima ka beta hai tera pisar nahi<br />
shabbir ke liye koi aisi sipar nahi</p>

<p>zehra se rutba poochiye is noor-e ain ka<br />
ye karbala me hoyega fidya hussain ka<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>